{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>{'text': 'Bamboo scaffolding craftsmanship is profound and extensive. Tin Shui Wai +WOO Kingswood Phase 2 shopping mall (formerly known as Kingswood Ginza) recently underwent repairs; the mall\\'s exterior features a pyramid-shaped structure. True occupational safety men, braving the scorching sun, humming \"Tracks of Grey,\" mustered the courage to climb to the top of the pyramid and erected the scaffolding, allowing other tradesmen to take over inspection and repair work. Looking from the bottom of the bamboo scaffolding, the internal structure is impressively intricate. Sharp bamboo poles support the entire scaffolding from the ground. To prevent the mall\\'s floor tiles from bearing the weight of the scaffolding, careful workers placed plywood against the bamboo poles as a \"buffer.\" The core interior of the mall\\'s pinnacle is supported by a steel structure, forming an interesting contrast with the internal bamboo scaffolding structure.'}</p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260910TinShuiWaiConstruction-1-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260910TinShuiWaiConstruction-2-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260910TinShuiWaiConstruction-3-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260910TinShuiWaiConstruction-4-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260910TinShuiWaiConstruction-5-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260910TinShuiWaiConstruction-6-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260910TinShuiWaiConstruction-7-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261012_TinShuiWaiConstruction-18-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261012_TinShuiWaiConstruction-23-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260910TinShuiWaiConstruction-8-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20260910TinShuiWaiConstruction-10-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T01:53:52.199321+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":952,"images":11,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T16:15:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T03:37:54.449227+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T01:49:46.938510+00:00","content_hash":"b122e94fa5a1841b010875d2d4fc50b145089c5de32900132fda8538732ee408","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}